      "comment": {
        "ja": "建物や敷地の中で AED がある場所（例：1階事務室）",
        "en": "Where in the building or site the AED is, for example 1階事務室"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/facility/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/facility/AEDLocation/#installationLocation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/facility/maleJapaneseStyleToilets",
